{
  "sequence_id": "seq_71033fec4de494fc",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Woah!!! ...The snake!!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Tremble"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Wriggle"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "TAKE IT OFF! TAKE IT OFF!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "themble"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This is bad! It's going to bite me!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "waaaahhh"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Nankuru- Naisa."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "skin"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "viper SAKE"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Know your"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "6.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Haha, you sure scare easy kid..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Pant pant"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But that's a good thing."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "........"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T17",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Real vipers are actually very Dan- Geros."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T18",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If you see a viper outside, you should get out of there right away!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T19",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Dw"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T20",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Viper"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T21",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If you get bitten, you might end up losing your life."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T22",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Do you know where snakes tend to bite the most?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T23",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Gulp..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T24",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Uh...? The legs?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T25",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yes! They go for the feet!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T26",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A bite to the feet will put you to sleep, and then you might never snake up again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T27",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...Get it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's dangerous even if you only get a small bite."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "That's because vipers are venomous!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Wiper show"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm serious!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If you see a viper, try asking if he's venomous!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "He'll tell you \"I may be venomous, but I've got a great POISON- ALITY\"!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Get it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's a lot of vipers on the island."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The other day, I was walking through the forest when a viper suddenly jumped out in front of me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "And what do you think the snake did next?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "fangfully, it moved out of the way!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I didn't even have to ASP!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Get it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Ha ha Ha"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This guy just won't stop."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's not just Kaidou, today has been full of annoying people."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T17",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We don't actually have a lot of time..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T18",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh, that's right~"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T19",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Let's start the show then..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T20",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Lift"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T21",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh! Is that the Mon- goose!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Here we go."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Third"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "... wh... what's with the TV ....?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It's the viper vs mon- goose fight."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'll be playing it on VCR."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "HUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU!!!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "They're not going to fight live!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That's how we used to do it, but now there are animal protection laws..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ehh... but then the winner is already pre-deter- mined..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It doesn't really matter, the mongoose is stronger every time."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I've been doing this job for a long time but I've never seen the viper win."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The fight is much garden for the snake."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ehhhh ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Okay, time to start the video."
    }
  ],
